  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fd3ecde65e0933d4d8e78e24e9ae3820, type: 3}
  m_Name: Henry's yearning
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  resourceName: About Darlene
  displayName: About Darlene
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  iconBackgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
  description: 
  useRegionalDescription: 0
  resourceDescriptionProfile: 
  optionalOverride: 0
  automatic: 0
  repeatable: 0
  audioProfileName: 
  dialogNodes:
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'Hello, traveller...


      Have you, by any chance, seen my Darlene? '
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: Yes, I have!
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: "Of course. Even up in that little room in the stable, how could
      one miss her beauty?\n\nShe is has the the most most striking of presences.
      \n\nThe most captivating eyes, the most melodic voice, the noblest of hearts,
      the-"
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: And you must be Henry!
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'Henry! Yes! I''m Henry!


      How did you know? Did she-


      Did
      she mention me?!!'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: She wants you to have this.
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'A letter! This is her handwriting!


      *Sigh*


      Before
      I open this... Traveller, I ought to confide something to you.'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: She wants you to have this
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'Me and Darlene... we haven''t been doing so well.

      It''s...
      it''s not her, it''s me. I''ve been avoiding her.


      She''s just so...
      perfect. And me, so... plain.'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: She wants you to have this
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'I''ve tried telling her this, but she''s so nice. She doesn''t
      want to hurt my feelings.


      So I took the liberty of removing myself
      from her life. For her sake.'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: She wants you to have this
  - startTime: 0
    showTime: 0
    description: 'I suppose this letter aims to make our parting official.


      Traveller,
      I beg of you. I can''t do this alone. Open this letter with me.'
    audioClip: {fileID: 0}
    nextOption: She wants you to have this
